    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's easy to say \"change and healing\" are possible, but some things just can't be fixed. some damage is permanent. i just don't see how anyone could ever see me the same way again, or how i could ever live with myself. it honestly feels like the only way to actually stop being a burden to everyone is to just... not be here. to just stop existing so they don't have to deal with me.",
